# EHR migration project risk register, scored per ISO 31000 / IEC 31010 consequence-likelihood matrix.
# cell (col,row) is zero-based: col = consequence level - 1, row = likelihood level - 1 (row 0 at the bottom).
# value = likelihood x consequence; label = risk IDs in that cell.
# R1 Medication lists mis-mapped: L4 x C5 = 20
# R2 Cut-over downtime over 48 h: L3 x C4 = 12
# R3 Lab interface vendor slips: L4 x C3 = 12
# R4 Lead clinical analyst leaves: L3 x C3 = 9
# R5 Nurses untrained at go-live: L4 x C2 = 8
# R6 Budget overrun above 10%: L2 x C3 = 6
# R7 Ransomware during cut-over: L2 x C5 = 10
# R8 Label printers misconfigured: L5 x C1 = 5
# R9 Legacy archive access lost: L1 x C4 = 4
# R10 Downtime drills not rehearsed: L3 x C4 = 12
# R11 Patient records wrongly merged: L3 x C5 = 15
